;; Cross-implementation reply conformance for the uniform managed-async
;; envelope (Managed-Effects).
;;
;; This is a test-only surface with no published source. It checks the core
;; reply substrate and builders in HTTP, resources, machines, and routing
;; against the shared `:status`, `:rf.reply/work-status`,
;; `:rf.reply/work-id`, stale-suppression, and egress-projection contracts.
;; The tests depend on several implementation
;; artefacts, so no single family's test tree can own them. Reply-target functor
;; laws remain owned by the core substrate and its independent timer consumer.
;;
;; The `.cljc` suites run in the top-level CLJS `:node-test` build. This alias
;; supplies the JVM counterpart, including the JVM reader-conditional paths,
;; and is invoked by `scripts/test-jvm-implementation.sh`.
;;
;; ## Why test-only deps, not :local/root in :deps
;;
;; The top-level `:deps` stays empty because this artefact ships nothing.
;; `:extra-paths` limits test discovery to this directory; the local-root
;; dependencies contribute production source, not their own test trees.
;;
;; ## Bundle isolation
;;
;; Dependencies flow from this test artefact to production artefacts only.
;; Production source does not require this surface, so it widens no bundle.
{:paths []
 :deps  {}

 :aliases
 {:test
  {:extra-paths ["test"]
   ;; Core supplies the shared substrate; the other artefacts supply the
   ;; family reply builders exercised by the conformance matrices.
   :extra-deps  {day8/re-frame2           {:local/root "../core"}
                 day8/re-frame2-http      {:local/root "../http"}
                 day8/re-frame2-resources {:local/root "../resources"}
                 day8/re-frame2-machines  {:local/root "../machines"}
                 day8/re-frame2-routing   {:local/root "../routing"}
                 day8/re-frame2-test-quiet {:local/root "../test-quiet"}
                 io.github.cognitect-labs/test-runner
                 {:git/tag "v0.5.1" :git/sha "dfb30dd"}}
   :main-opts   ["-m" "re-frame.test-quiet.runner"]}}}
